-     /* reaper 2026-09-19 (owner request): AMPDU RTS is the MASTER of the two threshold
-        rows below it. While it is Disabled, that radio's RTS Threshold and Fragmentation
-        Threshold inputs are greyed out and locked (syncRtsLock; stock's check_ampdu_rts
